[u][b][color=#00ffff][size=6]DELUXE HATS[/size][/color][/b][/u]

Deluxe Hats is a mod for Stardew Valley that brings unique mechanics to hats. The goal behind this mod is to give the player a better sense of achievement when they spend possibly hours to obtain a particular hat. Without this mod, hats only serve as a cosmetic item. With this mod, hats will have unique effects and buffs that alter gameplay, making them a worthwhile asset.

[b][color=#ff6600][size=5]FEATURES[/size][/color][/b]
[list]
[*][b]120 Hats with Effects[/b] - Every hat in Stardew Valley 1.6 now has a unique effect!
[*][b]Multiplayer Compatible[/b] - Fully supports online and splitscreen multiplayer. Each player's hat effects work independently.
[*][b]No Harmony Patching[/b] - Uses only SMAPI's native APIs for maximum stability and compatibility.
[*][b]Dynamic Buffs[/b] - Effects range from stat boosts to special abilities like spawning horses, shooting projectiles, and gaining friendship.
[/list]

[b][color=#ff0000][size=5]MULTIPLAYER REQUIREMENTS[/size][/color][/b]
[b]All players must have the mod installed[/b] for it to work correctly. The mod tracks each player's hat effects independently, so multiple players can wear different hats with different effects simultaneously.

[color=#00ff00][size=5][u][b]SAMPLE HAT EFFECTS[/b][/u][/size][/color]
[b]Combat & Defense Hats:[/b]
[b]Skeleton Mask[/b] - Shoot out bones when you get hit that deal 40 damage on impact
[b]Warrior Helmet[/b] - Battle Hardened: +4 Defense, +3 Attack
[b]Knight's Helmet[/b] - Knight's Valor: +2 Defense, +2 Attack
[b]Tiger Hat[/b] - Tiger's Prowess: +3 Attack, +2 Speed, +1 Defense
[b]Cat Ears[/b] - When hit, meow and gain Skittish Kitty: +3 Speed, +2 Attack

[b]Mining & Treasure Hats:[/b]
[b]Wearable Dwarf Helm[/b] - Understand Dwarves; When entering mine level gain +4 Mining, +2 Speed, +1 Attack
[b]Infinity Crown[/b] - Infinite Power: +4 Farming, +4 Mining, +4 Fishing, +3 Luck
[b]Iridium Pan[/b] - Iridium Mastery: +3 Mining, +3 Luck, +2 Attack
[b]Space Helmet[/b] - Cosmic Adventure: +3 Mining, +2 Luck

[b]Fishing Hats:[/b]
[b]Pirate Hat[/b] - Treasure Hunter: +2 Fishing, +2 Luck
[b]Blobfish Mask[/b] - Deep Sea Treasure: +3 Fishing, +2 Luck (at night)
[b]Sou'wester[/b] - Fishing in the Rain: +4 Fishing (outside in rain)
[b]Squid Hat[/b] - Deep Sea Dweller: +3 Fishing, +2 Defense

[b]Foraging Hats:[/b]
[b]Forager's Hat[/b] - Foraging Expertise: +3 Foraging, +1 Luck
