[b]Seasonal Hats:[/b]
[b]Blue Bonnet[/b] - Season Protection: +2 Foraging, +1 Farming, +1 Fishing (spring)
[b]Earmuffs[/b] - Season Protection: +2 Foraging, +1 Farming, +1 Fishing (winter)
[b]Hunter's Cap[/b] - Season Protection: +2 Foraging, +1 Farming, +1 Fishing (fall)
[b]Trucker Hat[/b] - Season Protection: +2 Foraging, +1 Farming, +1 Fishing (summer)
