[b]Social Hats:[/b]
[b]Butterfly Bow[/b] - Spawns butterflies; +5 friendship/7s to nearby NPCs (outdoor)
[b]Delicate Bow[/b] - Sparkles; +5 friendship/7s to nearby NPCs (indoor)

[b]Special Effect Hats:[/b]
[b]Chef Hat[/b] - Head Chef: Doubles buff from eating food
[b]Arcane Hat[/b] - Arcane Mastery: +2 Luck, +2 Speed, +1 Attack
[b]Totem Mask[/b] - Totem Preservation: Chance not to consume totem on use
[b]Sailor's Cap[/b] - Drunken Sailor: +10 Attack (when tipsy)

[b]Luck Hats:[/b]
[b]???[/b] - Mysterious Power: +10 Farming, +10 Fishing, +10 Foraging, +10 Mining, +10 Luck, +5 Speed, +5 Defense, +5 Attack, +5 Immunity
[b]Mr. Qi's Hat[/b] - Qi's Blessing: +5 Luck, +3 Mining, +2 Speed
