...and many more! See the complete list on [url=https://github.com/domsim1/stardew-valley-deluxe-hats-mod/HATS_AND_EFFECTS.md]GitHub[/url].

[b][u][color=#ff00ff][size=5]INSTALLATION[/size][/color][/u][/b]
[list=1]
[*]Install the latest version of [url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI[/url]
[*]Download this mod and unzip it into [font=Courier New]Stardew Valley/Mods[/font]
[*]Run the game using SMAPI
[*]For multiplayer: All players must install the mod
[/list]

